{"reviewId": "254854030_87T1tBEHx", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 13, "content": "2014年全国商品房销售、房价同比转跌，开发投资增速大幅回落，三四线库存高企，市场进入阶段性冷却。从周期定位看2014年是此前20年上行大周期的一个重要顶部，后续再未出现2009–2013年那样的全面、持续高景气。\n2016年9月 “房住不炒” 后调控全面收紧，2017–2018年市场逐步降温，2018 年四季度房价、成交、信心指数均回落至阶段低位，市场进入平稳调整状态。从2014年拐点算起到2018年正好约5年，时间跨度与作者预判一致且2018年确实是这一轮调整的阶段性终点。主要是2015-2016年的强政策刺激制造了一轮反弹，但并未改变2014年作为长周期拐点、2018年作为阶段调整结束的结论。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "2014年是中国房地产周期的高点，而这个拐点之后，地产周期将步入5年的调整期，至2018年结束", "range": "2359-2406", "chapterName": "08 康波衰退二次冲击正在靠近", "chapterIdx": 13, "reviewId": "254854030_87T1tBEHx", "userVid": 254854030, "topics": [], "createTime": 1774497514, "userEditTime": 1776599207, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "08 康波衰退二次冲击正在靠近", "author": {"userVid": 254854030, "name": "薄荷白桃乌龙茶", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83eotCrwSFSicibG99Nkf5vrg0ff5gIBNXvxUEHLjQOgqCkgge06Nib9Vp2791QZZJPKUpm1JVpXRn1RoA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240826-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 4, "likes": [{"userVid": 87131412, "name": "痞帅", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/Q3auHgzwzM5ibjQWreXYUHZANibk7tAkYib1hicYsdPzN1XLF9CgEGBh8A/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "痞帅", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M4-0-50", "desc": "阅读书籍", "t